# tally 2.2.1 P35 (L §8.2 l.2248, "an entry is listed under a result exactly when a read in its set gave it", whatever
# the form of the line, its outcome, or the way a movement came not to count): N1, a decision leg the pin puts after the read day lists the
# pin (review g2 reg/r9). Before W8: d_after no line.
=== r9.tally
model r9
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind promises: transfers uncertain
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input w: date
input wb: date
input pay: money PLN
move top: transfers
  on w
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to sav amount min(bal(konto), pay)
move bonus: promises
  on wb
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "s"
  w = 2026-03-10 "s"
  wb = 2026-03-10 "s"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
ask d_after: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-08
ask d_on: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-07
ask d_before: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-06
ask s_after: bal(sav, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-08
ask ds: bal(konto, 2026-03-07), bal(sav, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-08
ask u_after: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with wb = 2026-03-08 with uncertain
ask u_in: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with wb = 2026-03-06 with uncertain
ask u_no: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with wb = 2026-03-08
ask u_no_in: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with wb = 2026-03-06
=== expect d_after d_on
d_after: 500.00 PLN
  pinned: w = 2026-03-08
  cut 2026-01-01
d_on: 400.00 PLN
  pinned: w = 2026-03-07
  cut 2026-01-01
